加多采多姿。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">近三重最新百貨CITYLINK、全聯、711、運動場、圖書館、公園等。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">💵</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">14000</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">元的租金，不只包第四台、網路費＆💧水費！</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">🧓親切好溝通的房東與質感好鄰居，讓你接下來的租屋的生活有安心感。</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">-</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">🙇為了鄰里的健康問題，以下事項請注意！！！</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">🐕&nbsp;不接受毛小孩（寵物）入住</span></p><p dir=\"auto\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent;\">🚬🈲️止吸菸</span></p>\r\n附近有便利商店、傳統市場、百貨公司、公園綠地、學校、醫療機構、夜市。\r\n本房屋近菜寮捷運站、台北火車站。"}, "surround": {"title": "周邊配套", "key": "surround", "active": 1, "address": "三重區中正北路", "lat": "25.0653980", "lng": "121.4851120", "data": [{"name": "交通", "key": "traffic", "children": [{"type": "bus", "name": "果菜市場站", "distance": 32, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約32公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "三民街站", "distance": 217, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約217公尺"}, {"type": "bus", "name": "明志國中站", "distance": 224, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約224公尺"}]}, {"name": "生活", "key": "live", "children": [{"type": "shop", "name": "宏聲菸酒有限公司", "distance": 652, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約652公尺"}, {"type": "restaurant", "name": "羶村羊肉爐", "distance": 25, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約25公尺"}]}, {"name": "教育", "key": "education", "children": [{"type": "primary", "name": "新北市三重區重陽國民小學", "distance": 205, "distanceTxt": "距房屋約205公尺"}, {"type": "secondary", "na